IELTS.lesson({"test": 3, "part": 2, "title": "Test 3, Part 2 — the long turn", "candidate": "lama", "script": [{"who": "examiner", "text": "Now, I'm going to give you a topic and I'd like you to talk about it for one to two minutes.", "ar": "الآن، سأعطيكِ موضوعاً وأريدكِ أن تتحدّثي عنه مدة دقيقة إلى دقيقتين.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/93e218b519712f7a.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Before you talk you'll have one minute to think about what you're going to say. You can make some notes if you wish. Do you understand?", "ar": "قبل أن تتحدّثي سيكون لديكِ دقيقة واحدة للتفكير في ما ستقولينه. ويمكنكِ تدوين بعض الملاحظات إن أردتِ. هل هذا واضح؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/5a7c17f0603cb77a.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Yes, I understand.", "ar": "نعم، واضح.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/97c37df166c2b7ca.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Here is some paper and a pencil for making notes, and here is your topic.", "ar": "هذه ورقة وقلم لتدوين الملاحظات، وهذا موضوعكِ.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/dcc80d495df59156.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "I'd like you to describe a meal you still remember.", "ar": "أودّ منكِ أن تصفي وجبة ما زلتِ تذكرينها.", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/f02fc605c729067d.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a meal you still remember.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the meal was</li><li>where you ate it and who you were with</li><li>what was special about it</li><li>and explain why you still remember it</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "You have one minute. I'll tell you when the minute is up.", "ar": "لديكِ دقيقة واحدة. سأخبركِ عندما تنتهي الدقيقة.", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/2b1e1b3092896694.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a meal you still remember.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the meal was</li><li>where you ate it and who you were with</li><li>what was special about it</li><li>and explain why you still remember it</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "All right? Remember you have one to two minutes for this. Don't worry if I stop you. I'll tell you when the time is up. Can you start speaking now, please?", "ar": "حسناً؟ تذكّري أن لديكِ دقيقة إلى دقيقتين. لا تقلقي إن أوقفتكِ. سأخبركِ عندما ينتهي الوقت. هل يمكنكِ أن تبدئي الحديث الآن من فضلك؟", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/12de1969ab105c17.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a meal you still remember.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the meal was</li><li>where you ate it and who you were with</li><li>what was special about it</li><li>and explain why you still remember it</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "It was at my grandmother's, about two years ago, on the Friday after I finished my second year exams. Yabrak, so vine leaves with rice and meat in them.", "ar": "كانت عند جدّتي، قبل سنتين تقريباً، في الجمعة التي تلت انتهاء امتحانات سنتي الثانية. يبرق، أي ورق عنب محشوّ بالأرزّ واللحم.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/630a1ce425da3868.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a meal you still remember.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the meal was</li><li>where you ate it and who you were with</li><li>what was special about it</li><li>and explain why you still remember it</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "That matters, because it isn't a dish anyone makes in a hurry.", "ar": "وهذا مهمّ، لأنّه ليس طبقاً يُعدّ على عجل.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/e4858b77bec4997d.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a meal you still remember.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the meal was</li><li>where you ate it and who you were with</li><li>what was special about it</li><li>and explain why you still remember it</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "It takes three people and most of a morning, and that's really the point of it.", "ar": "يحتاج ثلاثة أشخاص ومعظم صباح، وهذا هو المقصد منه في الحقيقة.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/1a12affa584314e9.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a meal you still remember.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the meal was</li><li>where you ate it and who you were with</li><li>what was special about it</li><li>and explain why you still remember it</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "There were three of us rolling: my grandmother, my aunt and me.", "ar": "كنّا ثلاثاً نلفّ: جدّتي وخالتي وأنا.", "shot": "two", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/816161b5b60844e6.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a meal you still remember.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the meal was</li><li>where you ate it and who you were with</li><li>what was special about it</li><li>and explain why you still remember it</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "What made it unusual is that it was the first time I'd been allowed to do it properly, in the row that gets served.", "ar": "ما جعلها غير عاديّة أنّها كانت المرّة الأولى التي يُسمح لي فيها أن ألفّ فعلاً، في الصفّ الذي يُقدَّم على المائدة.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/4b15d16d7368f2f7.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a meal you still remember.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the meal was</li><li>where you ate it and who you were with</li><li>what was special about it</li><li>and explain why you still remember it</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I was slow and about a third of mine came out the wrong shape, and my grandmother watched me do every one of them and said nothing.", "ar": "كنت بطيئة وخرج ثلث ما لففته تقريباً بشكل غير صحيح، وجدّتي راقبتني وأنا ألفّها كلّها ولم تقل شيئاً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/383475938348b25f.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a meal you still remember.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the meal was</li><li>where you ate it and who you were with</li><li>what was special about it</li><li>and explain why you still remember it</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "That's why I remember it. She isn't a gentle woman about food. She has corrected my aunt, who is fifty, in front of guests.", "ar": "لهذا أذكرها. هي ليست امرأة لطيفة في أمور الطعام. لقد صحّحت لخالتي، وعمرها خمسون، أمام الضيوف.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/d48b8c5e0858c90d.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a meal you still remember.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the meal was</li><li>where you ate it and who you were with</li><li>what was special about it</li><li>and explain why you still remember it</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "And she sat there and let me put badly rolled vine leaves into the pot that everyone was going to eat from, which in her terms is an enormous thing to do.", "ar": "ومع ذلك جلست وتركتني أضع ورق عنب ملفوفاً بشكل سيّئ في القدر الذي سيأكل منه الجميع، وهذا بمقاييسها أمر هائل.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/f10b9d1e3a14220a.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a meal you still remember.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the meal was</li><li>where you ate it and who you were with</li><li>what was special about it</li><li>and explain why you still remember it</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Nobody said anything about it at lunch. Somebody probably got one of the bad ones.", "ar": "لم يقل أحد شيئاً عن ذلك على الغداء. غالباً وقع لأحدهم واحد من السيّئة.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/c59be32e5a114ef9.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a meal you still remember.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the meal was</li><li>where you ate it and who you were with</li><li>what was special about it</li><li>and explain why you still remember it</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I've thought since that this is how most things get handed over in a family. Nobody announces it, they just let you. I'd have been embarrassed if she'd made a speech about it.", "ar": "وفكّرت منذ ذلك الحين أنّ هكذا تُسلَّم معظم الأشياء في العائلة. لا أحد يعلن ذلك، هم فقط يتركونكِ تفعلين. كنت سأحرَج لو أنّها ألقت خطاباً عن الأمر.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/8d3c2e0917615333.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a meal you still remember.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the meal was</li><li>where you ate it and who you were with</li><li>what was special about it</li><li>and explain why you still remember it</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "So she made room instead, and then we ate.", "ar": "فأفسحت لي مكاناً بدل ذلك، ثمّ أكلنا.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/a9904c5ad07b1250.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a meal you still remember.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what the meal was</li><li>where you ate it and who you were with</li><li>what was special about it</li><li>and explain why you still remember it</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. Do you make that dish yourself now?", "ar": "شكراً لكِ. هل تعدّين ذلك الطبق بنفسكِ الآن؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/0425e121296d1909.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Twice. Both times badly, and both times with my grandmother on the phone from Damascus telling me what I'd done wrong, which I think she enjoys more than she'd enjoy the cooking.", "ar": "مرّتين. وفي المرّتين بشكل سيّئ، وفي المرّتين وجدّتي على الهاتف من دمشق تخبرني بما أخطأت فيه، وأظنّ أنّها تستمتع بذلك أكثر مما تستمتع بالطبخ نفسه.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/1755aefe91a566cf.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. That is the end of Part Two.", "ar": "شكراً لكِ. بهذا ينتهي القسم الثاني.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/264fec5248fac38c.mp3"}], "boxes": [{"q": "Describe a meal you still remember.", "bullets": ["what the meal was", "where you ate it and who you were with", "what was special about it", "and explain why you still remember it"], "long": true, "model": "It was at my grandmother's, about two years ago, on the Friday after I finished my second year exams. Yabrak, so vine leaves with rice and meat in them. That matters, because it isn't a dish anyone makes in a hurry. It takes three people and most of a morning, and that's really the point of it. There were three of us rolling: my grandmother, my aunt and me. What made it unusual is that it was the first time I'd been allowed to do it properly, in the row that gets served. I was slow and about a third of mine came out the wrong shape, and my grandmother watched me do every one of them and said nothing. That's why I remember it. She isn't a gentle woman about food. She has corrected my aunt, who is fifty, in front of guests. And she sat there and let me put badly rolled vine leaves into the pot that everyone was going to eat from, which in her terms is an enormous thing to do. Nobody said anything about it at lunch. Somebody probably got one of the bad ones. I've thought since that this is how most things get handed over in a family. Nobody announces it, they just let you. I'd have been embarrassed if she'd made a speech about it. So she made room instead, and then we ate.", "modelBand": 8.0, "why": "grandmother's, after finals yr 2 yabrak — 3 of us rolling she let me do it badly the handing over"}, {"q": "Do you make that dish yourself now?", "model": "Twice. Both times badly, and both times with my grandmother on the phone from Damascus telling me what I'd done wrong, which I think she enjoys more than she'd enjoy the cooking.", "modelBand": 8.0, "why": ""}], "voices": {"examiner": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "candidate": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119"}});
